<pr_title>
Security fixes and auth route refactoring for PR #879
</pr_title>

<pr_description>
## ✅ PR #879 Complete: Security Fixes + Backend Refactoring + Critical Security Patches

### 🔒 Critical Security Fixes (NEW)

#### 1. Token Invalidation on Mismatch
- **Files**: `emailVerification.ts`, `passwordReset.ts`
- **Issue**: Tokens were not cleared on failed verification attempts, allowing brute-force attacks
- **Fix**: Tokens now invalidated immediately on any mismatch attempt
```typescript
// Before: token persists after failed attempt
if (!isTokenMatch(token, hash)) {
  return null; // Token still valid for next attempt
}

// After: token cleared on failed attempt
if (!hash || expired || !isTokenMatch(token, hash)) {
  if (hash) {
    // Clear token to prevent further attempts
    userToUpdate.tokenHash = undefined;
    await saveDatabase();
  }
  return null;
}
```

#### 2. Correct Rate Limiter
- **File**: `authRoutes.ts`
- **Issue**: Email verification confirm used password reset limiter (20/15min instead of 5/hour)
- **Fix**: Applied dedicated `emailVerificationLimiter` (5 requests per hour)

#### 3. TOCTOU Vulnerability Fix
- **File**: `registration.ts`
- **Issue**: Pre-lock checks created Time-of-Check-Time-of-Use race condition
- **Fix**: Moved all checks inside `withFileLock` with specific error handling
- **Maintains**: Specific error messages for username vs email conflicts (required by tests)

### 📝 Code Quality Improvements (NEW)

#### 4. Dedicated Email Verification Schema
- **Files**: `schemas.ts`, `emailVerification.ts`
- **Issue**: Reused `PasswordResetRequestSchema` causing semantic confusion
- **Fix**: Created dedicated `EmailVerificationRequestSchema`

### Original Review Feedback (14 Items) ✅
- [x] **Security &amp; Privacy** - PII removed, username sanitization, email error handling
- [x] **Configuration Validation** - MAIL_TRANSPORT runtime validation
- [x] **Code Quality** - TypeScript interfaces, named exports, proper validation
- [x] **Rate Limiting** - Dedicated email verification limiter
- [x] **Documentation** - API clarifications, email verification notes
- [x] **Accessibility** - Navigation link titles

### Backend Refactoring ✅
- [x] Split 425-line authRoutes.ts into focused modules (11 files)
- [x] Single-responsibility handlers
- [x] Independently testable components

### ✅ Comprehensive Validation

**All Tests Pass:**
- Auth Routes: ✅ 15/15 passed
- No behavioral regressions
- Specific error messages maintained

**Security:**
- ✅ Token brute-force prevented
- ✅ TOCTOU race condition eliminated
- ✅ Proper rate limiting enforced
- ✅ TypeScript compilation: No errors

**Impact:**
