### 4. **Remove redundant user existence checks**
**File:** `server/src/routes/auth/handlers/registration.ts` (lines 37-44)

**Issue:** Pre-lock checks for existing username/email are redundant since the same checks happen inside `withFileLock` (line 48). This creates a Time-of-Check to Time-of-Use (TOCTOU) vulnerability.

**Fix:**
```typescript
